    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d925">

                <pb facs="0949" n="837" xml:id="pg837"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 761.94/30.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Russian
                        Ambassador.</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d925-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-07-30"><hi rendition="#italic">July 30,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 195.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your excellence’s note of June 28–July 11, 1910, transmitting a copy
                    of the convention between Russia and Japan signed at St. Petersburg on June
                    21–July 4.</p>
                <p>Understanding that the object of the convention is to confirm the status quo as
                    established by all the treaties of the Powers with or relating to China, and by
                    the unanimous declarations of the Powers regarding the equality of opportunity
                    and preservation of Chinese sovereignty, I am happy to find in the new
                    convention, as pointed out by your excellency, an additional pledge of the
                    stability of general peace in the Far East.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Huntington
                    Wilson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d925-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d925-f1-content">
                <p>Mutatis mutandis, to the Jananese ambassador.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
